  "body": "For more information, please download the files within the link: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/NDEU\r\n\r\nElevated in an established Millwater neighbourhood, this substantial family home offers a flexible layout with excellent separation between living spaces and bedrooms. High ceilings feature throughout the open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, with engineered stone benchtops, gas cooking and dual ovens adding to the appeal of the large kitchen. An expansive north-facing deck wraps around the home, surrounded by established gardens that create a private setting for outdoor entertaining, with the option to reclaim some of the decking for lawn and make the space your own. Four double bedrooms include two master suites, with the substantial downstairs suite enjoying its own entrance, walk-in wardrobe and ensuite. Ideal for extended family, teenagers or guests, this versatile space could also be used as a second living area, giving the home flexibility as your needs change.\r\n\r\n* Elevated position in an established Millwater neighbourhood\r\n* Flexible downstairs master with own access, ensuite and walk-in wardrobe\r\n* Options for extended family, teenagers, guests or additional living\r\n* Main master with direct deck access, ensuite and large walk-in wardrobe\r\n* Spacious open-plan living with high ceilings and laminate flooring\r\n* Large kitchen with engineered stone benchtops, gas cooking and dual ovens\r\n* Expansive north-facing wrap-around deck with scope to create additional lawn\r\n* Established gardens providing excellent privacy\r\n* Ducted heating and cooling throughout\r\n* Double garage with additional off-street parking\r\n\r\nClose to Millwater's schools, parks and local shopping amenities, with Orewa Beach just a short drive away, the location adds further appeal for families. The owners are motivated to make their next move, and with a layout offering so many possibilities, we encourage you to come and explore the property for yourself.\r\n\r\nWe work with all agents from day one.",
